  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムパワーの　ひとつ。\nいっていじかん　やせいポケモンと\nぜんぜん　であわなくなる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무파워 중 하나.\n일정 시간 야생 포켓몬과\n전혀 만나지 않게 된다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "洛托姆之力的一種。\n在一定時間內會變得\n完全無法遇見寶可夢。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une des Motism’Auras. Elle permet de ne plus\nrencontrer de Pokémon sauvages durant une\npériode déterminée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Rotom-Kraft bewirkt, dass für eine\nbestimmte Zeit keine wilden Pokémon erscheinen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Poder Rotom que permite evitar por completo los\nencuentros con Pokémon salvajes durante un\ntiempo determinado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Potere Rotom che permette di evitare\nl’incontro con i Pokémon selvatici\nper un certo lasso di tempo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the Rotom Powers.\nIt prevents you from encountering wild Pokémon for\na certain period of time.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
